# Muon on the 2021 reference (gpt3_rope.bux, positions.bux's rope), its model
# unchanged, as muon_2020.bux does on the 2020 baseline: Muon for the matrices in the
# blocks at Moonlight's update RMS of 0.2, AdamW at the reference's 2e-3 for the rest.
# A training option, not architecture.
use gpt3_rope
use timeline_code
use rungs

optimizer = muon(lr=2e-3, weight_decay=0.1, adam=adamw(lr=2e-3, weight_decay=0.1))
